  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Establishing a New Contraceptive Method</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This programme aims to increase access to a new injectable contraceptive across some of the world&apos;s poorest countries. This injectable - known by its current brand name &apos;Sayana Press&apos; - is well-suited to low-resource settings, and offers the potential for self-injection. This programme will respond to demand for the new injectable across the 46 UNFPA Supplies target countries, located in Africa, Asia Pacific, Latin America and the Middle East.</narrative>
  </description>
